  "details": "I don't mind a pinch selection method when using hand tracking, but with controllers it just feels wrong, especially after years of the old pointer orientation. It'd take a lot of getting used to at the very least, and I'd expect a lot of backlash if it made it to public. \n\nOn the off chance this doesn't happen for non-hand-tracking headsets, I should clarify I'm using a Quest 1 with Virtual Desktop and hand tracking enabled, but still using controllers. I also had full-body tracking, since that was a known bug at one point.",
